Display the five objectives in numbered cards:

1. To be an outstanding academic institution.
2. To help students appreciate the value of hard work for self reliance.
3. To attract a professional and committed workforce.
4. To strengthen co-curricular activities for better health and skills development of students.
5. To produce citizens who are God fearing and tolerate the existence of one another.

