# 10. ABOUT THE SCHOOL

Create a dedicated `/about` page.

Include:

### Our Story

St. Kalooli Lwanga SS Mulajje is a Catholic-founded secondary school located in Mulajje Parish, Kasana Luweero Diocese. It has been a government-aided secondary school since 2011.

The school was started in **1986** by **Rev. Sr. Babirye Domitila**, who was Sr. Mukulu of Mulajje Convent at the time.

The idea of starting the school was taken forward by **Rev. Fr. Matthias Ssimbwa**, who was the Parish Priest at that time.

