# 21. RESPONSIVENESS

The website must look excellent on:

* Mobile phones
* Tablets
* Laptops
* Desktop monitors

Pay special attention to mobile navigation.

Create a beautiful animated mobile menu.

Avoid horizontal scrolling.

---

# 22. ANIMATIONS

Use tasteful animations only.

Examples:

* Fade-up sections
* Image reveal
* Card hover
* Smooth scrolling
* Hero entrance
* Timeline animations
* Button hover effects

Do NOT over-animate the website.

The website should feel professional rather than like a gaming website.

Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

---

# 23. ACCESSIBILITY

Follow good accessibility practices:

* Semantic HTML
* Proper headings
* Alt text
* Keyboard navigation
* Accessible buttons
* Good color contrast
* Focus states
* ARIA labels where necessary

---

# 24. SEO

Implement proper SEO.

Use:

### Title

St. Kalooli Lwanga SS Mulajje | Only the Best is Good Enough

### Description

St. Kalooli Lwanga SS Mulajje is a Catholic-founded, government-aided secondary school in Mulajje Parish, Luweero District, Uganda, committed to academic excellence, self-reliance, character and holistic student development.

Add:

* Open Graph metadata
* Twitter/X metadata where appropriate
* Favicon
* School logo support
* Sitemap
* Robots configuration
* Structured data where appropriate

---

# 25. PERFORMANCE

Optimize the website for speed.

Use:

* Optimized images
* Lazy loading
* Responsive image sizes
* Proper font loading
* Code splitting where appropriate
* Minimal unnecessary JavaScript
* Reusable components
* Clean imports

The site should perform well on slower Ugandan mobile networks.

---

# 26. SECURITY & CODE QUALITY

Do not expose secrets.

Do not put API keys in frontend code.

Use environment variables when necessary.

Keep the project organized and production-ready.

Avoid unnecessary dependencies.

Use TypeScript properly if the project is TypeScript-based.

Avoid `any` unless genuinely necessary.

---

# 27. CLIENT-FRIENDLY CONTENT STRUCTURE

Make it very easy for another developer to update:

* School name
* Logo
* Hero image
* Gallery images
* Leadership
* Phone numbers
* Email
* Vision
* Mission
* Motto
* Core values
* News
* Events

without searching through dozens of components.

Centralize editable content.

---

# 28. IMPORTANT: DO NOT INVENT INFORMATION

Only use the information supplied about St. Kalooli Lwanga SS Mulajje.

Do NOT invent:

* Student population
* Fees
* UNEB results
* School rankings
* Boarding status
* Subject combinations
* Admission requirements
* Staff numbers
* Facilities
* Awards
* Clubs
* Sports achievements
* Historical facts
* Testimonials

If information is missing, create a tasteful editable placeholder.

