# 29. VISUAL IMAGE REQUIREMENT

The website should contain MANY visual sections.

Use school photographs supplied by the client where available.

Suggested image locations:

1. Hero
2. About section
3. School history
4. Leadership
5. Academic section
6. Student life
7. Campus
8. Gallery
9. Co-curricular activities
10. Admissions CTA

If actual images are unavailable, leave beautiful placeholders with comments such as:

```text
